lear missiles and hydrogen bombs  as for his other powers blue marvel has  superhuman senses and reflexes and is  able to fly by manipulating the  gravitational and electromagnetic fields  around him when he's in flight he's able  to fly faster than the speed of sound  and has achieved a velocity high enough  to overcome earth's gravitational pull  he's also able to harness and manipulate  energy on a massive scale he was able to  channel enough energy to carol danvers  to allow her to achieve her binary form  which is said to equal the amount of  energy contained in a star  and is capable of destroying an entire  planet so the question becomes this  how does one go about killing someone  this powerful well it's not going to be  easy as he's practically impervious to  harm from conventional means meaning  we're not going to be able to do  something like use conventional weaponry  or blunt force to get the job done and  so we're just going to have to get a  little bit creative in how we go about  taking out the blue marble and i think  the first step we can take  is to analyze what weaknesses and  limitations he might have  and formulate a plan around those and so  as i stated earlier blue marble is  basically a human antimatter reactor  which allows him to produce an insane  amount of energy but although his energy  reserves are vast they are not infinite  and for all the energy that he expends  his body has to replace it at the same  rate or he'll begin to suffer fatigue  which has happened on the occasion  that he expended massive amounts of  energy and so theoretically if we could  place him in a situation where he needed  to expend  such a quantity of energy that his body  couldn't instantly replace it he would  become more vulnerable to attacks due to  the energy that fuels his strength and  durability being depleted so to do this  we would need to create a situation  where he is facing another being of  immense power and so it may not be  practical  however what could work would be the  creation of some sort of device that  would siphon off the anti-matter energy  from blue marvel and basically have the  same effect of decreasing his durability  and leaving him susceptible to more  conventional attacks  as powerful as blue marvel is he does  have other weaknesses for instance he  has been shown to have at least  some vulnerability to magic as a  sorcerer was able to prevent him from  moving on one occasion however we don't  know how far this vulnerability goes or  how powerful a spell we would need to  get the job done something that i think  presents a more interesting method is  his weakness to a substance known as  neutronium which exists within a region  between realities called exospace or the  neutral zone  this region was actually discovered by  blue marvel himself while searching for  his son  that had been stranded there blue marvel  also theorized that neutronium a  material abundant in the neutral zone is  a byproduct  of the creation of the universe and  describes it as crystals of frozen  space-time and when he enters the  neutral zone he must wear a suit of  armor that allows him to survive there  for mere minutes at a time  and so as durable as blue marvel is he's  extremely vulnerable to neutronium which  gives us our best shot at taking him out  if we can somehow sabotage his  exploration armor so that it does not  provide the necessary protection when he  enters the neutral zone or more  proactively find a way to create a  weapon made from neutronium or that  projects neutronium at blue marvel i  think we have a very good chance  of killing him but with that being said  guys we're gonna bring this video to an  end if you guys are new here to thomas  explain make sure you guys hit the sub  button to become part of the rob core if  you guys enjoyed this video make sure  you drop a like and make sure you leave  a comment down below letting me know who  you want me to take out next and i will  catch you all